    "Iqa‘ Yuruk Semai is originally a Turkish usul. It is very popular in the Muwashah genre, and is alternatively called Yugrug. When it accelerates, it may modulate to Iqa‘ Sama‘i Darij in 3/4 or Iqa‘ Sama‘i Saraband in 3/8."
  ],
  "text": "Iqa‘ Yuruk Semai 6/8 Iqa‘ Index Pronunciation of Yuruk Semai Iqa‘ Yuruk Semai is originally a Turkish usul. It is very popular in the Muwashah genre, and is alternatively called Yugrug . When it accelerates, it may modulate to Iqa‘ Sama‘i Darij in 3/4 or Iqa‘ Sama‘i Saraband in 3/8. Muwashah Ahwa al-Ghazal al-Rabrabi Al-Kindi Ensemble Muwashah ‘Unq al-Malih al-Ghali Sabri al-Mudallal Muwashah Bil-Ladhi Askara Louis Hage and Aida Chalhoub Muwashah Ila Kam Dha al-Tamadi Ensemble Morkos Cèdre Muwashah Qad Hala Shurb al-Mudam Al-Turath Ensemble Muwashah Qum Ya Nadim Sabah Fakhri Music by ‘Umar al-Batsh Muwashah Ya Bahjet el-Rouh Sabah Fakhri Music by Sayyed Darwish Iqa‘ Yuruk Semai 6/8 Tabla demonstration by Faisal Zedan",
